        "chars": 253,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        230,
        1786,
        1265,
        2177
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"All requests for space, whether funds are to be\nprovided under the Mayor's Expense Budget or from\nCapital Budget appropriations, shall be processed\nthrough the Department of Real Estate as agent for\nthe Board of Estimate. In the case of requests\ninitiated by the Board of Education, the need for\nthe housing requested, including the number of\npersonnel allocated to the activity, will be con-\nfirmed by the chief fiscal officer of the Board\nof Education.\"",
